;
; How Cutwater files one clip of an edit list, in MYRA (cutwater_rules.h
; CR3): under the clip's place in the list (at most 64 clips), its track
; and its source (each 1 .. 8), the first frame it takes (cutin), the
; frame after its last (cutout) and where it lies on its track's timeline
; (place), each a frame count of 9 digits, each sign aside. Cutwater asks
; whether the numbers fit before it keeps them; that the clip itself is
; valid is edit_clip_ok.
^ZXCUTWATER(clip:i2) = track:i1! ^ source:i1! ^ cutin:i9! ^ cutout:i9! ^ place:i9!
